        {
          "text": "Lino ndakati, Bamusamike citambala cisalala cisambide amutwe wakwe, Nkabela bakamusamika citambala cisambide amutwe, akumusamika zikobela, angelo wa-Jehova naakaimvwi nku ko,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
