                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Na uende munzi la zyangu akubamba imbeta zyangu, uyooendelezya iŋanda yangu akuba abwami munkuta zyangu, alimwi njookuzumizya kunjila akati kabaaba baimvwi ano, ",
