        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mpoonya awo abbwe ndindabika kumeso aa-Joshua, ibbwe lyomwe lijisi mabazu aali musanu aabili, njoolemba bulembo, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu, Nkabela njoogwisya milandu yanyika eyi mubuzuba bomwe buyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
